   "title": "Note: Resolution",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Resolution\n\nH3's native canvas is a **768 px short edge**, max 768 x 1344. Set Width/Height to one of:\n\n| Aspect | Width x Height |\n|---|---|\n| 1:1 | 768 x 768 |\n| 3:4 | 768 x 1024 |\n| 9:16 | 768 x 1344 |\n| 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n\nThe portrait is center-cropped to this size before it reaches H3, so the first frame (stretched by the node) and the last frame (cropped by the node) are identical."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
